        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the target character in <Picture 1>: a gorgeous young Asian woman with delicate facial features, bright expressive eyes, a captivating sweet smile, and long dark brown wavy hair cascading over her shoulders. She has a slender graceful figure with bare midriff and long smooth legs, wearing the complete authentic four-piece lingerie ensemble exactly as depicted in <Picture 1>: 1) a delicate pink floral embroidered bra with thin black straps and lace trim, 2) matching low-rise pink and black lace panties, 3) thin black vertical garter suspension straps along her thighs, and 4) wide black floral lace thigh bands encircling each upper thigh.\n<Subject 2> is the dance performance in <Video 1>.\n<Video 1> is a grayscale geometry/normal reference: it encodes ONLY the body's per-frame 3D shape, orientation and limb positions. Read the motion from it frame by frame and ignore its surface appearance.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Reproduce <Video 1>'s per-frame body geometry and choreography — every turn, bend, side-facing pose and limb crossing, with its exact timing and rhythm — while strictly keeping <Subject 1>'s face, hair, body shape and her four-piece lingerie outfit from <Picture 1>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nA photorealistic full-motion video of <Subject 1> dancing in medium full-body framing, synchronized to the music. Follow the geometry reference pose-for-pose, frame-for-frame, preserving small motions and pauses without skipping, compressing or re-choreographing. Keep the pink floral lace bra, matching panties, thin black vertical garter straps and wide black lace thigh bands from <Picture 1> intact in every frame. Tidy warm indoor room, soft natural light, crisp detail, no blur, no distortion, no watermark."
      ]
